    -> exm:alw:⊤

*-> type          - mapping type of any entity
    -> exm: Convert("HelloWorld":◬⩲"ru":◒⩲"colloquial")→▸()

*-> uid          - unique id like UUID or unique key autoincrement if SQL uuid in program or physical entity 
    -> exm:❄:auto

*-> unique - unique, singlton of any entity
    -> exm:unq:⊤

*-> unit        - any abstract unit
    -> exm: ❑: 
            ->unit:id="router":name="router":model=type {physical router d-link dir 300}
            -> unit:id="o_service":name="service model=type {service of lan packet recursion}"
            -> class:name="route service":type=service:target=router

*-> up - direction sign: up

*-> upercase - upercase any text conversation or mapping
    -> exm: ≕⩲uper("HEllO") 
    -> exm: ≕⩲"Hello world":uper

